sequenceDiagram
accTitle: A short launch invocation starts a separate long-running task
accDescr: An S3 upload event invokes a Lambda launcher, which starts an ECS Fargate task and returns. The task continues transcoding for about 40 minutes, then reports an output or failure independently of the launcher.
participant S as S3 upload
participant L as Lambda launcher
participant E as ECS Fargate
participant J as Durable job tracking
S->>L: Object-created event
L->>J: Claim idempotent job
L->>E: RunTask with input key
E-->>L: Task accepted
Note over L: Invocation can finish
E->>E: Transcode for about 40 minutes
E-->>J: Task exit status and output
Note over J: Validate success or arrange retry
